title: "Post-Session Execution Assurance (PSEA): Reference Specification"
abstract: >
  Reference specification for the PSEA security model — cryptographic proof
  of authority at the moment of action, independent of session state.
  Companion to IETF Internet-Draft draft-yossif-psea-01.
